@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
hide empty members

class Duke
class BakerCli
class CustomerCli
class Parser <<utility>>
class "XYZCommand" as Command
class OrderList
class Order
class Storage
class CakeQueueException

Duke --> BakerCli : runs in baker mode
Duke --> CustomerCli : runs in customer mode
Duke --> Storage : loads and saves
Duke --> OrderList : owns

BakerCli ..> Parser
CustomerCli ..> Parser
BakerCli ..> Command
CustomerCli ..> Command
Command ..> OrderList : reads/changes
Storage ..> OrderList : fills/reads
OrderList o-- "*" Order

Parser ..> CakeQueueException : throws
Command ..> CakeQueueException : throws

note right of Command
  XYZCommand stands for the command
  classes, such as FindCommand and
  CapacityCommand.
end note
@enduml
